          "end": 72.78,
          "en": "to see how to use pipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 72.78,
          "end": 75.84,
          "en": "And you will see it's actually pretty simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 75.84,
          "end": 78.6,
          "en": "To change it, we have to go to the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 78.6,
          "end": 80.919,
          "en": "to the HTML file, because remember",
          "zh": ""
