          "end": 83.58,
          "en": "a pipe is only responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 83.58,
          "end": 85.28999999999999,
          "en": "for transforming the output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 85.28999999999999,
          "end": 87.39,
          "en": "So the right place to use it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 87.39,
          "end": 89.681,
          "en": "logically is the template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 89.681,
          "end": 92.00999999999999,
          "en": "Now here I want to change this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 92.00999999999999,
          "end": 94.8,
          "en": "server instance type thing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 94.8,
          "end": 97.92,
          "en": "I'll just bring it into a new line here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 97.92,
          "end": 100.02000000000001,
          "en": "And the same for servers started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 100.02000000000001,
          "end": 102.93,
          "en": "just to make it a bit easier to read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 102.93,
          "end": 106.25999999999999,
          "en": "And now I would like this server instance type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 106.25999999999999,
          "end": 108.21000000000001,
          "en": "to be uppercase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 108.21000000000001,
          "end": 109.65,
          "en": "Now that's easy to achieve.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 109.65,
          "end": 113.49000000000001,
          "en": "We just add the pipe symbol, hence to name pipes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 113.49000000000001,
          "end": 115.2,
          "en": "and then the name of the pipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 115.2,
          "end": 116.19,
          "en": "And as mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 116.19,
          "end": 118.22999999999999,
          "en": "there are a couple of built-in pipes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 118.22999999999999,
          "end": 120.3,
          "en": "and you can also build pipes on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 120.3,
          "end": 121.35,
          "en": "We'll have a look at this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 121.35,
          "end": 122.67,
          "en": "in one of the next lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 122.67,
          "end": 124.23,
          "en": "Now a good built-in pipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 124.23,
          "end": 126.45,
          "en": "for making this all upper case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 126.45,
          "end": 127.86,
          "en": "Of course, it's the upper case pipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 127.86,
          "end": 129.87,
          "en": "you saw on the slide before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 129.87,
          "end": 133.83,
